      "text": "Throughout my career as a LCSW, I've focused on helping people with their mental health, learning a lot along the way. Back in 2018, I started my own therapy practice, but I had no clue what I was doing. I read tons of books and articles, asked for advice on Facebook, and listened to podcasts. It was a process of trial and error, but eventually, I figured things out."
